{"id":276235,"slug":"private-practice-2007","title":"Private Practice","title_en":"Private Practice","year":2007,"rating":75,"votes_count":765,"runtime_min":null,"age_rating":null,"title_type":"seriál","vod_date":null,"plot":"Hlavní hrdinkou tohoto seriálu je Addison Montgomery, kterou již známe ze seriáluCHIRURGOVÉ. Je výbornou chirurgičkou, která přijíždí do L.A., aby znovu našla smysl svého života. Zde začíná pracovat v soukromé ordinaci, která se specializuje na problémy s otěhotněním, ale i partnerstvím, manželstvím a dětmi... Je zde velmi speciální tým lékařů, z nichž každý má dosti komplikovaný osobní život.Ačkoliv se jedná o další seriál z lékařského prostředí, je zde kladen velký důraz i na mezilidské vztahy a blízké kontakty mezi pacienty a lékaři. Jedná se o komornější seriál (počet hlavních hrdinů je omezen).(adri_anna)","poster":"https://image.pmgstatic.com/cache/resized/w140/files/images/film/posters/168/089/168089989_14aw1h.png","backdrop":null,"trailer_youtube_id":null,"genres":["Komedie","Drama","Romantický"],"tags":["doktoři"],"countries":["USA"],"directors":["Mark Tinker","Tony Goldwyn","Arvin Brown","Julie Anne Robinson","David Solomon","Michael Grossman","Wendey Stanzler","Tom Verica","Helen Shaver","Michael Pressman","Michael Zinberg","Paul Adelstein","Bill Purple","Jeff Melman","Ann Kindberg","Edward Ornelas","Steve Robin","Randy Zisk","Rob Corn","Joanna Kerns","James Frawley","Bethany Rooney","Kate Woods","Allison Liddi-Brown","Steve Gomer","Donna Deitch","Eric Stoltz","Karen Gaviola","Matthew Penn","Kenny Leon","Jeff Bleckner","Jeannot Szwarc","Stephen Cragg","Amyn Kaderali","James Larkin","Scott Printz"],"actors":["Kate Walsh","Audra McDonald","Tim Daly","Taye Diggs","Paul Adelstein","Amy Brenneman","Christopher Lowell","KaDee Strickland","Caterina Scorsone","Benjamin Bratt","Brian Benben","Sprague Grayden","Max Arciniega","Barbara Eve Harris","Bellamy Young","David Sutcliffe","Andy Milder","Joy Jorgensen","Tyler Patrick Jones","Rebecca Mad